  "row_guide": "Band0 top-left: sand/grass/water terrain tiles and mounds. Top-right: buckets, shovels, sandcastles, crabs, starfish, towels, shells. Mid: BEACH arch, direction poles, blue info boards, ship/shark bar + counters/stools/tables, palm, open/closed umbrellas. Lower: thatched stalls, PA speakers, DJ/mixer, crowd barriers, stage stairs, boardwalk decks, metal trusses + spotlights, example stages. Bottom: volleyball net/lines/ball, float rings, seagulls, land and sea rocks. Band1: sea/arch rocks, buoys, tropical plants, standalone trusses, boardwalk + foggy variants, full lighthouse + open top, lens mechanisms, roofs, doors, searchlight. Band2: lighthouse ring base/mid/balcony segments; sandy cliff modular walls + wooden cliff stairs; big/small sand-mountain modulars and example plateaus; grass tufts."
}
